cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below (and cite RTSA / TSA for the boundary computations, see COPYRIGHTS.md)."
type: software
title: "tsacor-java: Trial Sequential Analysis for meta-analyses of correlations (Java edition of tsacor)"
version: 0.1.1
license: GPL-2.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/tarak-dhaouadi/tsacor-java"
url: "https://github.com/tarak-dhaouadi/tsacor-java"
abstract: >-
  A stand-alone desktop and command-line application (no R needed) for Trial
  Sequential Analysis of meta-analyses of correlations (Pearson r or Spearman
  rho, pooled on Fisher's z scale). It runs the same analysis as tsa_cor() in
  the R package tsacor (this edition mirrors tsacor 0.1.1).
keywords:
  - trial sequential analysis
  - meta-analysis
  - correlation
  - Fisher's z
  - sequential monitoring boundaries
  - Java
authors:
